Import "pairs.clean"

Define certify pair data(X,Q,h):
  Let X: TopologicalSpace
  Let Q: SpacePairData(X)
  Let h: Evidence((Q.relative ⊆ Q.ambient))
  Returns: TopologicalPair(X)
  Equals: topological pair(X,Q.ambient,Q.relative,h)
  Render latex: \widehat{{{Q}}}

